<title>USA: U.S. zinc production and shipments up in January.</title>
<headline>U.S. zinc production and shipments up in January.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. zinc smelter production in January rose to 21,635 short tons, up from 20,791 short tons a year ago, the American Bureau of Metal Statistics said.</p>
<p>Shipments from plants in January totaled 21,043 short tons, up from 19,288 short tons a year ago.</p>
<p>Inventories at plants and elsewhere in the U.S. in January were 7,499 short tons, down from 8,452 short tons a year ago.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
